Original Decipher card face for [[Artoo, Brave Little Droid]], as shown in the card list on Decipher's own website.

Source: [http://decipher.com:80/starwars/cardlists/theedpalace/light/images/artoobravelittledroid.jpg artoobravelittledroid.jpg], Decipher.com card list. Preserved copy: [https://web.archive.org/web/20020607070723/http://decipher.com:80/starwars/cardlists/theedpalace/light/images/artoobravelittledroid.jpg Internet Archive], 7 June 2002. SHA-256 of the archived file: 136e03996118159ef3bddd968c0258f69548cb031c9fc40b62dc29c15a5a97f3.

Edits: none. The archived bytes are uploaded unchanged.

The Holotable face [[:File:Theed-L-artoobravelittledroid.gif]] is a separate file and is not replaced by this file.

Fair use rationale: this is a low-resolution image of a copyrighted Star Wars Customizable Card Game card, © Lucasfilm Ltd. and Decipher Inc. It is used only to identify and discuss the card on this non-commercial fan wiki, it does not replace any product sold today, and no free equivalent exists.

